# ── Rootwise AI configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Without any key, Rootwise runs in demo mode: both built-in courses, the
# diagnostic engine, the teacher dashboard and an offline tutor all work.
# Add ONE of the following to unlock AI course generation, the Socratic
# tutor and AI-graded teach-back.

# Google Gemini — free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (recommended)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: pin a model (default tries gemini-3.5-flash → gemini-flash-latest → gemini-3.1-flash-lite)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
# Optional: reasoning depth for Gemini 3.x (minimal | low | medium | high | off). Default: low
# GEMINI_THINKING=low

# OpenAI or any OpenAI-compatible API (OpenRouter, Together, vLLM, …)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Groq (OpenAI-compatible, very fast)
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# Force a provider: gemini | openai | groq | demo
# AI_PROVIDER=
